  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "WebSocket Protocol Refactor:\n      - Data Plane Split: WsModel now acts as a dedicated data plane for frame parsing.\n      - Logic Separation: Moved session/client logic to WssSessionProtocol and WsClientProtocol.\n      - Static Send Engine: Refactored BuildFrame to static for zero-instance transmission.\n      - SIMD Unmasking: Accelerated payload unmasking with AVX2/SSE2 for microsecond latency.\n      - BinaryPrimitives: Used BinaryPrimitives for high-speed 16/64-bit header packing.\n      - Allocation-Free: Eliminated model renting overhead during high-throughput multicast.\n      - Lock-Free Hot Path: Removed internal parsing locks to maximize multi-core saturation.",
